<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1532_5535.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pürlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruotz</unclear> und guot willig dienst
<lb n="2"/>und was wir ehren liebs und guotz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegend</unclear>, mit
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wünschung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eines</unclear> von gott dem allmechtigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glückhafftige</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüwen</unclear> jars, zuo vor fromm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> vest <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vürsichtig</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>ehrsam wiß in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> guot fründ und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> lieb
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">püren</unclear>. Demnach zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemmen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ds</unclear> unser
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">man</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lloeus</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grone</unclear></persName> vor uns er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schinen</unclear> ist, mit
<lb n="8"/>an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeigung</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ds</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ongfar</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">drü</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jaren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> üwerm
<lb n="9"/>burger <persName resp="#ner">Anthony <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schaedly</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">blaich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedienet</unclear>,
<lb n="10"/>da <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> vil liebs unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schehen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sije</unclear> aber
<lb n="11"/>wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sines</unclear> ongebürlichen haltens gegen
<lb n="12"/>üch in ongnaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">konen</unclear>, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> er etliche
<lb n="13"/>jar üwer statt unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mijden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mueßen</unclear>.
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Welliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> gar <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwaerlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> er wol wider
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotij</unclear> dienst alda ouch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> üwerm burger ainer mit
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">namen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zacher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sichlinger</unclear></persName> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">blaich</unclear> meister,
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fündij</unclear>, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear> etlich mal darumb an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sprochen</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/>wil und aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sine</unclear> jar nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allenklichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flossen</unclear>,
<lb n="19"/>so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thut</unclear> er uns gantz fründtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear> umb ein für
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gellschrifft</unclear> an üch, wie er sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zit</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wil</unclear> er in unserm
<lb n="21"/>land gesin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> halten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habij</unclear>, dero wegen wir
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frome</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warhafftij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lüth</unclear> so umb sin sachen guot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>tragend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoert</unclear>, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> iren ehren unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trüwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sagt</unclear>, er habe sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromklich</unclear> ehrlich unnd
<lb n="25"/>wol gehalten, und die wil er sich vor uns ouch an
<lb n="26"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">potten</unclear>, für baß ouch wol zuo halten, wie einem
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepürt</unclear>, und ouch der maßen mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> geredt,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1532_5536.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/>So ist von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sindt</unclear> wegen an uech, unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früendt</unclear>: unnd
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachpuerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesinnen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellend</unclear> gedachtem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Clauß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerer</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> gunst und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnaden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekennen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jn</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>betrachtung dz er jung und by den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgeren</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>lust zuo diennen, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieduerch</unclear> unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füer</unclear> geschrifft genossen
<lb n="33"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuerliche</unclear> trüw <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkennen</unclear>, und wir dz selbig
<lb n="34"/>gegen üch in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebüerlichen</unclear> fählen zuo ver
<lb n="35"/>diennen wol geneigt, mit hilff deß lieben Gottes in
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welchchem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schutz</unclear> und schirm wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> jeder zith wol
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bennellende</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dato</unclear> <origDate when="1607" resp="#ner">den 14 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tg</unclear> Januarij anno 1607 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">j</unclear>.</origDate>
<lb n="38"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-565" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Landtaman und rath der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">usßeren</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>roden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> landts Appenzell</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1532_5537.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1532_5538.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dem</unclear> frommen, ehrenvesten, fürsichtigen, ehr-
<lb n="41"/>sammen und weisen herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister
<lb n="42"/>und Rath der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> Sanct Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstigen</unclear> lieben herren und
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertrauwten</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpauren</unclear>.
</p>
